{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"1404fb057bc5d112b6346816325dee0ee8a74030ba18767f6f29f0e588eca9ab","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":49,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["雅各的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["雅各把他的兒子們都叫來，對他們說：「你們到我身邊來，我要把你們將來的遭遇告訴你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「雅各的兒子們啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聚在一起聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽你們父親以色列的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呂便啊，你是我的長子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我年輕力壯時生的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卓有尊榮和力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你必不再居首位，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你放縱情慾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如沸騰不止的水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你上了你父親的床，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污了我的榻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「西緬和利未是兄弟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們依仗刀劍，殘暴不仁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的靈不可與他們同謀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心不可與他們聯合。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們洩憤殺人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨意砍斷牛腿的筋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們狂怒兇殘，該受咒詛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他們分散在雅各的子孫中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"散居在以色列各地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「猶大啊，你的兄弟們必讚美你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的手必掐住仇敵的頸項，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你父親的兒子必向你下拜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我兒猶大是頭小獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他獵食回來，躺臥如雄獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蹲伏如母獅，誰敢驚擾他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"權杖必不離猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"御杖必伴他左右，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到執掌王權的那位來到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民都必歸順他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「他把小驢拴在葡萄樹旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把驢駒拴在上好的葡萄樹旁；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在葡萄酒中洗衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在葡萄汁中洗外袍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的眼睛比酒烏潤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的牙齒比奶潔白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"「西布倫必安居在海濱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為泊船的港口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的疆界必伸展到西頓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「以薩迦是頭壯驢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臥在羊圈中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他見那地方好作安身之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地土肥美，就垂下肩頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做了苦役。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「但必治理他的人民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作以色列的一個支派。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必成為路邊的蛇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"道旁的毒蛇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"咬傷馬蹄，使騎馬的人墜落。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我切切等候你的拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「迦得必被強盜劫掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他卻要反敗為勝追趕他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「亞設必有豐美的出產和供君王享用的美味。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「拿弗他利是頭自由的母鹿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"養育美麗的小鹿","poem":1},{"noteId":55},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"「約瑟是多結果子的枝條，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長在水泉旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的枝條探出牆外。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弓箭手兇猛地攻擊他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡狠狠地射他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他手持強弓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雙臂穩健有力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為雅各的大能者出手相助，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是以色列的牧者和磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你父親的上帝必幫助你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能者必賜你天上的福氣、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地下深淵蘊藏的福氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你子孫興旺、牛羊滿圈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你父親的祝福高過亙古的峰巒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"多如永存的群山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願這一切祝福都臨到約瑟頭上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨到這超越眾弟兄的人身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"「便雅憫是匹貪婪的狼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨吞吃獵物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晚上瓜分戰利品。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["以上是以色列的十二支派，他們的父親按著他們不同的福分給他們祝福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["雅各又囑咐他們說：「我要離世了，你們要把我葬在赫人以弗崙田間的洞裡，讓我與祖先在一起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["那洞穴在迦南的幔利附近的麥比拉田間，是亞伯拉罕向赫人以弗崙買來作墳地的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["亞伯拉罕和他的妻子撒拉，以撒和他的妻子利百加都葬在那裡，我把利亞也葬在了那裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["那塊田和田間的洞穴是向赫人買的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["雅各囑咐完眾子，把腳收到床上，嚥了氣，歸到他祖先那裡。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":55,"caller":"+","text":"「養育美麗的小鹿」或譯「口出佳美之言」。","reference":{"chapter":49,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/49.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/50.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/48.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":33}